  "afterSalahHadith": "Allahumma Rabba hadhihi ad-da'wat at-tammah, wa as-salat al-qa'imah, ati Muhammadan al-wasilata wa al-fadilah, wa ab'ath-hu maqaman mahmuda nilladhi wa'adtah",
